1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,367
This is NTSOne, from NTS Digital Solutions. One platform for
registrations, voting, orders, payments and bookkeeping.

2
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:19,940
Running events, elections, orders and money across paper
forms, spreadsheets and notebooks is slow, and mistakes are
easy to make.

3
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:27,658
NTSOne gives your organization one private workspace, with a
dashboard that shows everything at a glance.

4
00:00:28,158 --> 00:00:37,201
Build registration forms with drag and drop, share a link or
a QR code, and issue ID cards and tickets that can be
checked at the door.

5
00:00:37,701 --> 00:00:44,259
Run secret-ballot elections, with optional paid votes and
live results that update as people vote.

6
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:52,762
Give your business an online order page, and create
invoices, receipts, quotations and business cards in
minutes.

7
00:00:53,262 --> 00:01:01,496
Accept Orange Money, Africell Money and QMoney, and follow
every payment, refund and withdrawal in your payment fund.

8
00:01:01,996 --> 00:01:09,309
Keep simple books, track monthly contributions, and manage
wish lists, all in the same place.

9
00:01:09,809 --> 00:01:15,738
NTSOne. One platform. Endless possibilities.
